infographic chart-bar-plain-text
data
  title CIDR host bits: the exponential lever
  desc Host bits set the block size as 2^bits — each bit doubles it, so a /8 aggregate hides 16,777,216 addresses behind one route
  values
    - label /30 → 2 host bits = 4 addr
      value 2
    - label /24 → 8 host bits = 256 addr
      value 8
    - label /16 → 16 host bits = 65,536 addr
      value 16
    - label /8 → 24 host bits = 16,777,216 addr
      value 24
theme
  palette #6366f1 #14b8a6
